<title>POLAND: BANK GDANSKI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 40.</title>
<headline>BANK GDANSKI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 40.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six kerb transactions in a total of 6,260,240 shares in Bank Gdanski at 40 zlotys were struck on the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Bank Gdanski traded at 47 zlotys in a 12,331-share volume.</p>
<p>On Friday bank BIG said it had agreed to buy from the state treasury 6,260,240 Bank Gdanski shares at 40 zlotys per share and to increase its stake to about 63 percent.</p>
<p>BIG declined to comment on the Monday's kerb transactions before the session's official close at 1330 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
